Design a 4-bit binary counter that increments on each rising edge of the clock (CLK) when enabled (EN). The counter resets to zero when the reset signal (RST) is asserted. Once the counter reaches its maximum value of 15 (4'hF), it will wrap around and reset to zero on the next increment, allowing for continuous counting in a cyclic manner.
module top_module(
  input CLK, RST, EN,
  output reg [3:0] Q
);

