description:
Design a request arbitrator that outputs grants based on input requests and a base value. It takes a WIDTH-bit input vector of requests and produces a WIDTH-bit output vector of grants. The module doubles the request vector to manage user requests and applies a base mask to disallow certain requests. The module ensures that the grants correspond to the allowed requests while maintaining a fair arbitration among multiple requesters.
module top_module(
    req, grant, base
);

code:
module top_module(
    req, grant, base
);parameter WIDTH = 16;

input wire [WIDTH-1:0] req;
output wire [WIDTH-1:0] grant;
input wire [WIDTH-1:0] base;

wire [2*WIDTH-1:0] double_req = {req,req};
wire [2*WIDTH-1:0] double_grant = double_req & ~(double_req-base);
assign grant = double_grant[WIDTH-1:0] | double_grant[2*WIDTH-1:WIDTH];

endmodule

