Implement the Verilog module based on the following description.
Build a 5-bit binary counter with a load enable signal and synchronous active high reset signal.
// (1) reset: Resets the counter to 5'b00000.
// (2) load: Loads a specified value into the counter when high.
// (3) data: 5-bit value to be loaded when load is high.
// (4) q: The value of the counter.

